nunmadxagtik" is not valid), and you have some unnecessary usage of
{cu} (on line 8 "la biblos. cu selsku", which actually doesn't make
sense, btw). (While we're on the topic, you should never have to use
CU, so if it looks like you need it, then you need to not use it and
study more instead.)

